# Face-down exile grants each exiling player permission to play the other's land
# (CR 406.3b, 305.2); normal land timing and the one-land limit still apply.
[Bot1 Deck]
Vulcan Mind-Meld
Mox Sapphire
Island x5
Mountain
Island x12
[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Plains
Swamp
Island x12
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
